  "answer_text": "Here's an overview of what you can find on **FedEx.com**:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude9a FedEx \u2014 Shipping, Tracking & More\n\n### \ud83d\udd11 Key Features on FedEx.com\nYou can use FedEx.com to **log in to your FedEx account**, get your **tracking status**, **find a FedEx near you**, learn more about how to become a better shipper, get online print offers, or get inspiration for your small business needs.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udce6 FedEx Express Shipping Services\nFedEx offers a range of express options, including:\n- **FedEx Overnight** \u2013 Fast, reliable next-day delivery\n- **FedEx 2Day\u00ae** \u2013 Cost-effective, time-specific delivery in 2 days\n- **FedEx Express Saver\u00ae** \u2013 Cost-effective delivery in 3 days\n- **FedEx International Priority\u00ae** \u2013 International delivery in 1 to 3 days\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfe0 FedEx Home Delivery\nFedEx provides **fast, reliable, on-time residential shipping services**. With FedEx Home Delivery, you can get **day-definite home delivery \u2014 even on evenings and Saturdays**.\n\nFedEx Home Delivery delivers within **1\u20135 days every day of the week**, including Saturday and Sunday (excluding Hawaii and Alaska).\n\nFedEx Home Delivery can handle items **up to 150 lbs., up to 108\" in length, and 165\" in length plus girth**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf0d International Shipping\nFedEx lets you **expand your reach to 130+ countries and territories**. FedEx Global Air Freight gives you the support, visibility, and expertise you need to cross borders with confidence.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf81 FedEx Rewards\nWhen you **join FedEx Rewards**, the extras start immediately \u2014 you'll get a **$10 gift card for your first eligible shipment**. Open a FedEx account to get started.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcb2 FedEx One Rate\u00ae\nWith **FedEx One Rate\u00ae**, you get **flat-rate, 2-day shipping** for packages up to 50 lbs.\n\n---\n\n### \u2708\ufe0f Vacation Hold\nYou can **place a vacation hold with FedEx Delivery Manager\u00ae** for up to **14 days \u2014 for free**!\n\n---\n\nYou can visit **[www.fedex.com](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/home.html)** directly to ship a package, track a shipment, find a nearby FedEx location, or manage your deliveries. Is there something specific you'd like help with regarding FedEx services?",
